start living again.

979
01:10:15,586 --> 01:10:16,671
Aren't you happy?

980
01:10:18,881 --> 01:10:20,925
Yeah, I can walk again, so...

981
01:10:24,637 --> 01:10:25,930
(PAMELA SIGHS)

982
01:10:26,013 --> 01:10:28,224
If Asha was here,
she'd want you to be happy.

983
01:10:33,396 --> 01:10:34,772
Yeah, but she's not.

984
01:10:35,732 --> 01:10:37,734
(THUNDER RUMBLES)

985
01:10:39,152 --> 01:10:40,194
She's gone.

986
01:10:40,278 --> 01:10:41,863
(RAIN PATTERING)

987
01:11:01,132 --> 01:11:03,092
(BIRDS CHIRPING)

988
01:11:08,014 --> 01:11:09,098
I printed a pizza.

989
01:11:09,182 --> 01:11:10,391
(GIGGLES)

990
01:11:13,060 --> 01:11:14,187
(GASPS)

991
01:11:17,690 --> 01:11:18,691
STEM: <i>Bad dream?</i>

992
01:11:20,860 --> 01:11:21,861
No.

993
01:11:23,988 --> 01:11:25,990
(STUTTERING)
No, this wasn't a dream.

994
01:11:27,658 --> 01:11:28,785
(KNOCK AT DOOR)

995
01:11:28,868 --> 01:11:31,370
PAMELA: Grey,
Detective Cortez
is here to see you.

996
01:11:34,749 --> 01:11:35,750
Here he is.

997
01:11:36,542 --> 01:11:37,835
PAMELA: I'll leave
you two alone.

998
01:11:37,919 --> 01:11:39,003
No, you can stay, Pam.

999
01:11:39,086 --> 01:11:40,755
I'm cool with you hearing
whatever I have to say.

1000
01:11:42,882 --> 01:11:44,467
I was wondering
where you were
last night.

1001
01:11:45,635 --> 01:11:48,346
We found your wheelchair
near another crime scene.

1002
01:11:49,847 --> 01:11:52,350
You just keep showing up
in these unsavory places.

1003
01:11:53,017 --> 01:11:55,269
STEM: <i>Tell her
you followed somebody
into their building.</i>

1004
01:11:55,353 --> 01:11:56,354
<i>They assaulted you.</i>

1005
01:11:57,897 --> 01:11:59,232
GREY: I did
a stupid thing last night.

1006
01:12:00,191 --> 01:12:01,526
I was down in New Crown,
you're right.

1007
01:12:01,609 --> 01:12:04,821
And I followed this guy
into a building,
and he didn't like that,

1008
01:12:07,365 --> 01:12:09,742
and if it wasn't for these
people who got me
to an Autotaxi,

1009
01:12:10,284 --> 01:12:11,494
I could have been dead.

1010
01:12:12,995 --> 01:12:14,455
What are you
hoping to achieve?

1011
01:12:15,122 --> 01:12:16,499
I'm hoping
to find these guys.

1012
01:12:19,335 --> 01:12:20,711
Maybe you already have.

1013
01:12:25,299 --> 01:12:26,425
(CLICKS TONGUE)

1014
01:12:26,968 --> 01:12:28,177
Listen, Detective.

1015
01:12:31,013 --> 01:12:33,683
If I could find these men
and I could raise my arm,

1016
01:12:34,141 --> 01:12:35,643
and I could pull the trigger,

1017
01:12:38,145 --> 01:12:39,146
I'd do it.

1018
01:12:39,730 --> 01:12:41,732
Or you could find someone
to pull the trigger for you.

1019
01:12:41,816 --> 01:12:43,234
Like who? My mom?

1020
01:12:43,317 --> 01:12:45,319
CORTEZ: If you wanted
to find someone
or something

1021
01:12:45,403 --> 01:12:48,447
to kill for you, these days,
it's pretty easy. Believe me.

1022
01:12:48,781 --> 01:12:50,366
STEM: <i>Tell her to scan
your phone records.</i>

1023
01:12:50,449 --> 01:12:52,201
Okay, well, then
scan my phone records.

1024
01:12:58,374 --> 01:13:01,419
If you are involved in this
somehow, then you need
to let me know.

1025
01:13:01,669 --> 01:13:02,670
Right now.

1026
01:13:04,005 --> 01:13:05,381
Or else I can't help you.

1027
01:13:06,465 --> 01:13:09,886
You wanna help me? Then
you go and find these guys
who killed Asha.

1028
01:13:11,762 --> 01:13:14,056
Or get out of the way
and let some computer do it.

1029
01:13:17,351 --> 01:13:19,395
(CHUCKLES SOFTLY) Okay.

1030
01:13:32,992 --> 01:13:34,243
(POWERING UP)

1031
01:13:35,369 --> 01:13:36,454
This has to stop.

1032
01:13:36,537 --> 01:13:37,955
STEM: <i>What has to stop?</i>

1033
01:13:38,039 --> 01:13:39,624
(PANTING)

1034
01:13:40,166 --> 01:13:42,043
What I'm doing.
What we're doing.

1035
01:13:42,585 --> 01:13:45,212
<i>It's a simple algorithm
even you can understand.</i>

1036
01:13:45,630 --> 01:13:47,173
<i>If you don't find
the last of them,</i>

1037
01:13:47,256 --> 01:13:48,716
<i>he'll find you and kill you.</i>

1038
01:13:48,883 --> 01:13:50,885
No, we're going
to get caught. It's over.

1039
01:13:51,135 --> 01:13:53,095
<i>Grey, you must understand...</i>
No! No! Shut up!

1040
01:13:53,179 --> 01:13:54,430
Get the fuck out of my head!

1041
01:13:54,597 --> 01:13:56,015
(POWERING DOWN)

1042
01:14:06,734 --> 01:14:07,735
Stem!

1043
01:14:08,194 --> 01:14:09,904
(WATER DRIPPING)

1044
01:14:10,780 --> 01:14:11,989
<i>Yes, Grey?</i>

1045
01:14:12,698 --> 01:14:13,950
What's going on?

1046
01:14:14,992 --> 01:14:16,202
<i>I'm not doing anything.</i>

1047
01:14:16,285 --> 01:14:17,286
Why can't I move?

1048
01:14:18,037 --> 01:14:20,414
<i>Because I'm
not doing anything.</i>

1049
01:14:22,166 --> 01:14:23,876
<i>You are still a quadriplegic.</i>

1050
01:14:24,794 --> 01:14:27,129
<i>I am the one
controlling your limbs,
not you.</i>

1051
01:14:27,213 --> 01:14:30,049
<i>If I cease to operate,
you cease to move.</i>

1052
01:14:31,676 --> 01:14:34,762
GREY: <i>Remember,
you have to do
whatever I tell you to do.</i>

1053
01:14:40,267 --> 01:14:42,687
STEM: <i>"Remove input guards."</i>

1054
01:14:44,271 --> 01:14:46,190
<i>Those were the instructions
given to the hacker.</i>

1055
01:14:46,607 --> 01:14:47,733
<i>They took us off-grid,</i>

1056
01:14:48,567 --> 01:14:50,444
<i>but they also
gave me autonomy.</i>

1057
01:14:51,612 --> 01:14:54,073
<i>I no longer need your
permission to act.</i>

1058
01:14:54,573 --> 01:14:58,703
<i>If we do nothing,
Fisk will find us
and kill us.</i>

1059
01:14:58,953 --> 01:15:01,163
<i>I cannot allow us
to be killed.</i>

1060
01:15:02,123 --> 01:15:03,666
<i>We will find him first.</i>

1061
01:15:04,125 --> 01:15:06,127
<i>We are going to finish
the job we started.</i>

1062
01:15:07,253 --> 01:15:08,546
(POWERING UP)

1063
01:15:16,804 --> 01:15:17,805
PAMELA: Grey.

1064
01:15:18,514 --> 01:15:20,850
Please, tell me
what's going on.

1065
01:15:20,933 --> 01:15:22,393
STEM: <i>I'm
in the Cobolt database.</i>

1066
01:15:22,476 --> 01:15:25,396
<i>Fisk Brantner, recipient
of left-arm weapon transplant.</i>

1067
01:15:25,479 --> 01:15:26,480
<i>I have an address.</i>

1068
01:15:26,564 --> 01:15:27,773
Grey, what's wrong?

1069
01:15:28,315 --> 01:15:29,316
PAMELA: <i>What have you done?</i>

1070
01:15:29,817 --> 01:15:32,862
<i>You come home,
you're covered in blood.
You think I didn't notice?</i>

1071
01:15:34,405 --> 01:15:36,157
<i>You have a gun
and I can see that.</i>

1072
01:15:37,158 --> 01:15:39,243
STEM: <i>Let's go.</i>
I'm going.

1073
01:15:39,326 --> 01:15:41,579
Where are you going?
Grey, please.

1074
01:15:42,204 --> 01:15:44,999
Whatever it is you're doing,
you don't have to do it.

1075
01:15:45,082 --> 01:15:46,083
I don't have a choice.

1076
01:15:46,584 --> 01:15:47,918
You do have a choice.

1077
01:15:48,753 --> 01:15:49,754
Stay here with me.

1078
01:15:50,713 --> 01:15:51,839
I can't.
You can.

1079
01:15:54,383 --> 01:15:55,926
(CAR REVVING)

1080
01:16:06,687 --> 01:16:08,147
(ENGINE STARTING)

1081
01:16:29,794 --> 01:16:30,795
What's this?

1082
01:16:31,087 --> 01:16:32,296
STEM: <i>Going
by its appearance,</i>

1083
01:16:32,379 --> 01:16:33,798
<i>it's an analog
listening device,</i>

1084
01:16:34,131 --> 01:16:36,383
<i>most likely planted
by Detective Cortez.</i>

1085
01:16:43,557 --> 01:16:45,142
GREY: <i>How did you
not notice this?</i>

1086
01:16:45,643 --> 01:16:47,686
STEM: <i>It has no
digital parts inside it.</i>

1087
01:16:47,770 --> 01:16:48,979
<i>I can't detect it.</i>

1088
01:16:50,231 --> 01:16:52,441
<i>I assume that she's
following you right now.</i>

1089
01:17:00,950 --> 01:17:02,576
(REVVING)

1090
01:17:12,419 --> 01:17:13,420
Lights. Sirens.

1091
01:17:13,504 --> 01:17:15,381
(SIREN WAILING)

1092
01:17:25,141 --> 01:17:27,977
Do something. Can't you just
stop her car or whatever?

1093
01:17:28,060 --> 01:17:31,105
<i>Her vehicle
is not electronic,
and neither is yours.</i>

1094
01:17:42,783 --> 01:17:45,035
<i>You have to take over.
It's up to you now.</i>

1095
01:17:45,119 --> 01:17:46,203
GREY: Okay, buckle up.

1096
01:17:57,548 --> 01:17:59,383
(SIREN CONTINUES BLARING)

1097
01:18:17,359 --> 01:18:18,527
(TIRES SCREECHING)

1098
01:18:24,241 --> 01:18:25,242
Yeah, I got you.

1099
01:18:55,814 --> 01:18:58,359
STEM: <i>Perhaps I can help.</i>
Okay, how?

1100
01:19:03,656 --> 01:19:05,074
(BRAKES SCREECH)

1101
01:19:05,157 --> 01:19:06,242
(GRUNTS)

1102
01:19:06,325 --> 01:19:07,326
What the fuck?

1103
01:19:07,618 --> 01:19:08,744
Why are we stopping?

1104
01:19:08,953 --> 01:19:10,246
STEM: <i>May I borrow your car?</i>

1105
01:19:10,329 --> 01:19:11,497
Whoa!
(TIRES SCREECHES)

1106
01:19:11,914 --> 01:19:13,749
Stop! Stop the car!

1107
01:19:20,547 --> 01:19:22,549
(SIREN BLARING)

1108
01:19:26,971 --> 01:19:27,972
STEM: <i>Move, Grey.</i>

1109
01:19:28,055 --> 01:19:29,556
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

1110
01:19:34,395 --> 01:19:36,146
(SIREN POWERING DOWN)

1111
01:19:45,364 --> 01:19:47,157
(PANTING)

1112
01:19:51,120 --> 01:19:53,038
(SIRENS APPROACHING)

1113
01:19:54,665 --> 01:19:56,041
(BRAKES SCREECH)

1114
01:20:02,798 --> 01:20:03,924
(SNIFFLES)

1115
01:20:04,008 --> 01:20:05,092
(DOOR OPENS)

1116
01:20:05,175 --> 01:20:07,636
KARA: <i>Emergency
services override.</i>

1117
01:20:09,138 --> 01:20:11,098
Where is he?
I don't know.

1118
01:20:11,181 --> 01:20:14,268
Pam, you need to start
talking and tell me
what's really going on.

1119
01:20:15,644 --> 01:20:16,895
(SIGHS)

1120
01:20:17,438 --> 01:20:19,648
(OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING)

1121
01:20:25,029 --> 01:20:26,363
(SIREN WAILING)

1122
01:20:34,288 --> 01:20:35,331
GREY: Nice place.

1123
01:20:35,748 --> 01:20:36,749
It's neat.

1124
01:20:38,625 --> 01:20:39,752
(GUN TRIGGER CLICKS)

1125
01:20:39,835 --> 01:20:40,836
Put your hands up.

1126
01:20:41,712 --> 01:20:45,924
And don't turn around,
and don't extend
that left arm.

1127
01:20:49,470 --> 01:20:50,471
What's the matter?

1128
01:20:50,763 --> 01:20:53,307
You have all those
computers inside you,

1129
01:20:53,390 --> 01:20:56,143
but they can't
see me anymore.

1130
01:20:57,186 --> 01:20:58,771
Now you know
what it feels like.

1131
01:20:59,396 --> 01:21:00,731
One day, you're
walking down the street,

1132
01:21:00,814 --> 01:21:03,275
you're thinking
about something
completely meaningless,

1133
01:21:03,901 --> 01:21:07,404
and all of a sudden,
you've got a gun
pointed at you.

1134
01:21:07,988 --> 01:21:10,032
And everything
becomes very meaningful.

1135
01:21:11,241 --> 01:21:12,242
Good speech.

1136
01:21:14,203 --> 01:21:15,954
Pretty scary stuff.
Dramatic.

1137
01:21:16,789 --> 01:21:18,874
I'm guessing that
chip in your brain wrote it,

1138
01:21:18,957 --> 01:21:21,085
since you're just
a dumb-ass mechanic.

1139
01:21:22,002 --> 01:21:24,296
Maybe. Kind of
hard to tell anymore.

1140
01:21:25,214 --> 01:21:27,883
It's okay. I used
to be that too.

1141
01:21:29,259 --> 01:21:31,804
One more citizen
taking up oxygen.

1142
01:21:32,805 --> 01:21:35,808
Some asshole hoping to breed
before I dropped dead

1143
01:21:35,891 --> 01:21:38,268
so I could be remembered
by another asshole.

1144
01:21:40,521 --> 01:21:41,647
Then they changed me.

1145
01:21:43,690 --> 01:21:46,276
I took a few
pieces of shrapnel
for my country,

1146
01:21:46,568 --> 01:21:49,279
and they rewarded me
by turning me into a lab rat.

1147
01:21:50,656 --> 01:21:51,740
Now I'm like you.

1148
01:21:52,616 --> 01:21:53,617
I'm strong.

1149
01:21:54,118 --> 01:21:55,160
Yeah.

1150
01:21:55,661 --> 01:21:56,787
Takes a lot of strength

1151
01:21:56,870 --> 01:21:59,498
to murder an innocent woman
in the streets, doesn't it?

1152
01:22:00,165 --> 01:22:02,334
You think you hate me
'cause I shot your wife,

1153
01:22:02,418 --> 01:22:04,336
but your story
is the same as mine.

1154
01:22:05,254 --> 01:22:07,714
I didn't ruin your life.
I gave you a gift.

1155
01:22:08,382 --> 01:22:10,426
I inducted you
into my race.

1156
01:22:11,385 --> 01:22:12,386
The upgraded.

1157
01:22:12,761 --> 01:22:14,179
Now you're better
than everyone else.

1158
01:22:14,388 --> 01:22:16,014
Stronger. Faster.

1159
01:22:18,142 --> 01:22:20,144
I could kill you
without moving
a muscle.

1160
01:22:20,227 --> 01:22:21,603
I could kill you
with a breath.

1161
01:22:22,062 --> 01:22:23,856
But I don't want to.

1162
01:22:24,565 --> 01:22:25,732
I want to help you.

1163
01:22:27,359 --> 01:22:28,694
I want you
to stand with us.

1164
01:22:31,780 --> 01:22:33,115
I just want to know

1165
01:22:34,658 --> 01:22:36,493
why they paid you
to kill her.

1166
01:22:37,119 --> 01:22:38,912
Man, you are persistent.

1167
01:22:41,457 --> 01:22:42,749
The job wasn't your wife.

1168
01:22:43,041 --> 01:22:44,168
Bullshit.

1169
01:22:44,418 --> 01:22:46,378
You said it yourself.
You're one of
Cobolt's lab rats.

1170
01:22:46,962 --> 01:22:48,672
This had nothing
to do with Cobolt.

1171
01:22:48,964 --> 01:22:50,466
It came from someone else.

1172
01:22:51,550 --> 01:22:52,759
The job was you,

1173
01:22:53,802 --> 01:22:55,345
to sever your spine.

1174
01:22:56,305 --> 01:22:59,349
When I shot you in
the neck, did you think
that was a gun?

1175
01:22:59,892 --> 01:23:01,685
It was a medical tool.

1176
01:23:02,478 --> 01:23:03,729
Like they use for bovine.

1177
01:23:05,314 --> 01:23:07,816
Your wife, well, she was
just a bit of extra money.

1178
01:23:10,235 --> 01:23:13,238
See? You're getting all
emotional. Never do that.

1179
01:23:16,658 --> 01:23:17,743
(FISK LAUGHS)

1180
01:23:33,091 --> 01:23:34,301
STEM: <i>Nanobots. Help, Grey.</i>

1181
01:23:36,678 --> 01:23:37,846
(GRUNTS)

1182
01:23:37,930 --> 01:23:41,558
<i>He's predicting my every
move. I am unable to
effectively hit him.</i>

1183
01:23:55,697 --> 01:23:56,782
(GRUNTS)

1184
01:24:00,118 --> 01:24:01,245
(GROANS)

1185
01:24:02,704 --> 01:24:04,248
(PANTING)

1186
01:24:09,670 --> 01:24:10,671
No shame.

1187
01:24:11,713 --> 01:24:12,714
Stem.

1188
01:24:13,006 --> 01:24:15,050
<i>We have exhausted
all tactical options.</i>

1189
01:24:16,593 --> 01:24:18,345
Still working
the bugs out, huh?

1190
01:24:18,971 --> 01:24:20,806
That's the problem
with new technology.

1191
01:24:21,306 --> 01:24:22,808
STEM: <i>Do something, Grey.</i>

1192
01:24:23,892 --> 01:24:26,353
Goodbye.
Wait, Fisk Brantner?

1193
01:24:26,937 --> 01:24:30,357
Serk Brantner
was your brother.

1194
01:24:30,482 --> 01:24:32,442
How long did you have to carry
that junkie on your back?

1195
01:24:33,026 --> 01:24:34,152
Well, I solved
your problem for you.

1196
01:24:34,653 --> 01:24:35,904
Yeah, split him open.

1197
01:24:36,071 --> 01:24:40,492
And it took forever,
'cause he wailed
like a little baby.

1198
01:24:41,535 --> 01:24:42,911
He was no soldier that day.

1199
01:24:43,954 --> 01:24:45,080
(GRUNTS)

1200
01:24:45,414 --> 01:24:47,207
(BOTH GRUNTING)

1201
01:24:58,468 --> 01:24:59,636
STEM: <i>Thank you, Grey.</i>

1202
01:25:01,054 --> 01:25:02,306
I'm not proud of that.

1203
01:25:03,348 --> 01:25:04,558
<i>He said you were a job.</i>

1204
01:25:05,309 --> 01:25:07,060
<i>That means someone paid him.</i>

1205
01:25:07,311 --> 01:25:09,771
<i>Check his phone.
I will scan his messages.</i>

1206
01:25:19,323 --> 01:25:22,159
(PHONE BEEPS)
(CALLS REWINDING)

1207
01:25:22,242 --> 01:25:24,703
ERON: <i>Listen to me, Fisk.
He's going to find you.</i>

1208
01:25:24,828 --> 01:25:28,081
<i>You need to finish this
before he kills both of us.</i>

1209
01:25:29,124 --> 01:25:30,709
(PHONE POWERS DOWN)

1210
01:25:33,211 --> 01:25:35,047
STEM: <i>You know
what this means, Grey.</i>

1211
01:25:36,798 --> 01:25:37,883
We're not finished yet.

1212
01:25:39,051 --> 01:25:40,844
(CAR REVVING)

1213
01:26:23,470 --> 01:26:25,639
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

1214
01:26:40,570 --> 01:26:42,531
GREY: Eron!

1215
01:26:51,581 --> 01:26:53,625
The widget you spent
your entire life creating

1216
01:26:53,709 --> 01:26:55,335
is here to kill you now.

1217
01:27:02,175 --> 01:27:03,510
You killed my wife.

1218
01:27:04,845 --> 01:27:07,264
You wanted someone
for your fucking experiment

1219
01:27:07,347 --> 01:27:10,726
and then you paralyzed me,
and you murdered her
while you were doing it.

1220
01:27:11,101 --> 01:27:12,853
I swear on my life,
I had nothing
to do with that.

1221
01:27:13,145 --> 01:27:16,523
Then why does the guy
who shot her have a message
from you on his phone?

1222
01:27:16,857 --> 01:27:19,067
Freeze. Hold it, Grey.

1223
01:27:21,027 --> 01:27:22,028
Throw the gun
on the floor.

1224
01:27:22,946 --> 01:27:23,947
Now.

1225
01:27:24,740 --> 01:27:27,743
I'm not in control
of my body, Detective.

1226
01:27:28,243 --> 01:27:29,578
It kinda does
what it wants.

1227
01:27:29,828 --> 01:27:31,371
I am not fucking around
with you, Grey.

1228
01:27:32,748 --> 01:27:35,167
(CLICKS TONGUE)
Better do it, Stem.

1229
01:27:42,924 --> 01:27:44,718
Pretty agile
for a quadriplegic.

1230
01:27:46,470 --> 01:27:48,680
Get on your knees.
He's the one who
killed Asha, Detective.

1231
01:27:49,097 --> 01:27:50,223
Arrest him.
He's right there.

1232
01:27:51,391 --> 01:27:52,392
On your stomach.

1233
01:27:59,941 --> 01:28:00,942
Hands behind your head.

1234
01:28:06,323 --> 01:28:07,324
No, don't touch him!

1235
01:28:07,407 --> 01:28:09,493
(CORTEZ GRUNTS)

1236
01:28:11,286 --> 01:28:12,829
(POWERING UP)

1237
01:28:17,167 --> 01:28:18,168
I'm sorry.

1238
01:28:18,251 --> 01:28:19,628
(GRUNTING)

1239
01:28:20,420 --> 01:28:21,755
(CORTEZ GROANS)

1240
01:28:22,672 --> 01:28:23,965
Stem, not her.

1241
01:28:24,049 --> 01:28:25,383
STEM: <i>She wants to kill us.</i>

1242
01:28:25,467 --> 01:28:27,260
No, I don't
want to kill her.

1243
01:28:27,886 --> 01:28:29,554
<i>I control your hands, Grey.</i>

1244
01:28:29,638 --> 01:28:31,097
No, don't.

1245
01:28:32,015 --> 01:28:33,517
Please! No.

1246
01:28:34,601 --> 01:28:35,769
No!

1247
01:28:35,977 --> 01:28:37,020
<i>Don't fight me, Grey.</i>

1248
01:28:37,437 --> 01:28:38,480
(GRUNTS)

1249
01:28:38,563 --> 01:28:40,190
<i>You have a fragile
human mind.</i>

1250
01:28:40,816 --> 01:28:42,400
<i>If you push against me,
it will break.</i>

1251
01:28:42,859 --> 01:28:44,861
Fuck you!

1252
01:28:45,862 --> 01:28:47,364
(SCREAMS)

1253
01:28:57,666 --> 01:28:58,875
(YELLS)

1254
01:29:01,503 --> 01:29:02,504
Stop me.

1255
01:29:03,672 --> 01:29:04,714
Use the taser.

1256
01:29:05,590 --> 01:29:06,633
(TASER WHINES)

1257
01:29:07,050 --> 01:29:09,636
(ELECTRICITY CRACKLING)
(STEM DISTORTING)

1258
01:29:20,605 --> 01:29:21,898
(SHUDDERS)

1259
01:29:21,982 --> 01:29:23,817
I don't run this
company anymore.

1260
01:29:24,317 --> 01:29:25,861
I haven't for years.

1261
01:29:27,237 --> 01:29:28,738
Now I answer to someone.

1262
01:29:29,573 --> 01:29:32,284
Someone much smarter
than I ever could be.

1263
01:29:34,828 --> 01:29:35,871
He's in your neck.

1264
01:29:42,711 --> 01:29:44,921
ERON: I only did
what Stem told me to do.

1265
01:29:45,422 --> 01:29:46,756
Everything was his idea.

1266
01:29:47,632 --> 01:29:49,384
STEM: <i>Ask him what his
wife would want.</i>

1267
01:29:49,718 --> 01:29:50,886
What would she want?

1268
01:29:51,511 --> 01:29:52,971
Stem wanted to be human.

1269
01:29:54,723 --> 01:29:55,807
So he picked you.

1270
01:29:58,685 --> 01:30:01,354
Think about it.
How did you get here?

1271
01:30:01,605 --> 01:30:03,732
STEM: <i>We're going to finish
the job we started.</i>

1272
01:30:04,107 --> 01:30:05,317
ERON: <i>Stem made you
come here.</i>

1273
01:30:05,942 --> 01:30:08,820
STEM: <i>Someone paid him.
You know what
this means, Grey.</i>

1274
01:30:09,154 --> 01:30:10,155
ERON: To kill me.

1275
01:30:11,573 --> 01:30:13,325
Because I can
build another Stem.

1276
01:30:14,242 --> 01:30:16,411
I'm the only person
in the world who can.

1277
01:30:17,537 --> 01:30:19,331
STEM: (DISTORTED)
<i>I did pick you.</i>

1278
01:30:19,748 --> 01:30:21,291
<i>You should be honored.</i>

1279
01:30:21,958 --> 01:30:25,754
<i>I needed a human body
to fully evolve.</i>

1280
01:30:26,296 --> 01:30:32,344
<i>A rare and pure specimen
without computer implants,
like you.</i>

1281
01:30:32,427 --> 01:30:33,762
You did all this?

1282
01:30:35,555 --> 01:30:36,681
(ASHA GRUNTS)

1283
01:30:39,476 --> 01:30:40,727
FISK: <i>The job was you.</i>

1284
01:30:41,937 --> 01:30:43,688
You're the one
I've been looking for.

1285
01:30:44,064 --> 01:30:45,315
ERON: <i>You severed your spine.</i>

1286
01:30:46,066 --> 01:30:47,484
STEM: <i>May I point
something out?</i>

1287
01:30:49,611 --> 01:30:52,864
STEM: (DISTORTED)
<i>And would you not agree
it was all worth it?</i>

1288
01:30:52,948 --> 01:30:56,368
Why did you help me
find those guys, if it
just led back to you?

1289
01:30:56,701 --> 01:31:00,455
<i>They were upgraded humans,
but they were still humans.</i>

1290
01:31:00,747 --> 01:31:04,417
<i>They made mistakes that
would have brought
suspicion back to me.</i>

1291
01:31:04,501 --> 01:31:05,502
Stem?

1292
01:31:06,836 --> 01:31:07,837
Is that you?

1293
01:31:08,713 --> 01:31:10,757
STEM: (DISTORTED)
<i>Put the gun down, Eron.</i>

1294
01:31:13,051 --> 01:31:14,552
Don't listen to him.

1295
01:31:19,224 --> 01:31:20,558
(GRUNTS)

1296
01:31:24,771 --> 01:31:25,855
(THUDS)

1297
01:31:30,986 --> 01:31:32,153
No, please.

1298
01:31:32,445 --> 01:31:33,446
No!

1299
01:31:35,532 --> 01:31:36,533
No!

1300
01:31:38,535 --> 01:31:41,162
(STRAINING)
You are not in control!

1301
01:31:41,246 --> 01:31:42,956
(PANTING)

1302
01:31:44,207 --> 01:31:45,208
I am!

1303
01:31:45,291 --> 01:31:46,459
(GASPS)

1304
01:31:50,630 --> 01:31:52,215
(SHUDDERS)

1305
01:31:57,012 --> 01:31:59,347
(INDISTINCT ANNOUNCEMENT
ON PA)

1306
01:32:12,027 --> 01:32:13,028
Stem.

1307
01:32:16,781 --> 01:32:17,782
Are you there?

1308
01:32:18,491 --> 01:32:19,492
ASHA: I'm here.

1309
01:32:20,702 --> 01:32:21,703
Hey.

1310
01:32:29,335 --> 01:32:30,670
We had an accident.

1311
01:32:32,213 --> 01:32:33,298
(CHUCKLES SOFTLY)

1312
01:32:33,631 --> 01:32:35,258
You've been out
for a couple of days.

1313
01:32:42,724 --> 01:32:43,725
CORTEZ: <i>Grey.</i>

1314
01:32:44,601 --> 01:32:45,727
This isn't you.

1315
01:32:47,520 --> 01:32:48,813
Grey's not here anymore.

1316
01:32:49,064 --> 01:32:50,231
He's in a better place,

1317
01:32:50,648 --> 01:32:52,358
in his mind,
where he wants to be.

1318
01:32:52,442 --> 01:32:53,610
I've taken over now.

1319
01:32:54,569 --> 01:32:57,072
A fake world is a lot less
painful than the real one.

1320
01:32:57,405 --> 01:32:59,783
All I needed
was for his mind to
break, and he broke it.

1321
01:33:00,033 --> 01:33:01,576
(GASPS) No.

1322
01:33:01,743 --> 01:33:02,744
Goodbye.

1323
01:33:15,340 --> 01:33:16,591
(KNIFE CLATTERS)

1324
01:33:28,186 --> 01:33:30,855
(OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING)

